lla-Pasi.jpg 2x" src="https://cloud-1de12d.becdn.net/media/iW=297&amp;iH=297&amp;oX=59&amp;oY=0&amp;cW=221&amp;cH=225/86c6e2a0308cda1df6accc91fedb8c23/Full-Paper-Chair---Gabriella-Pasi.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" title="Full-Paper-Chair---Gabriella-Pasi.jpg" draggable="false"></picture></div></div><div id="" class="brz-css-d-1wonu5h brz-css-8ltaaj brz-wrapper"><div class="brz-rich-text brz-rich-text__custom brz-css-d-1ehz5mr brz-css-j6x3ng" data-brz-custom-id="oZghuU8eAmFh"><div data-brz-translate-text="1"><h4 class="brz-text-lg-center brz-tp-lg-heading4 brz-css-195gegk" data-generated-css="brz-css-dOWj3" data-uniq-id="zHDqd"><span data-brz-tooltip="%7B%22tooltipText%22%3A%22Gabriella%20Pasi%20is%20a%20Professor%20in%20the%20Department%20of%20Informatics%2C%20Systems%2C%20and%20Communication%20at%20the%20University%20of%20Milano-Bicocca%2C%20where%20she%20leads%20the%20Information%20and%20Knowledge%20Representation%2C%20Retrieval%2C%20and%20Reasoning%20(IKR3)%20Research%20Lab.%20Her%20main%20research%20interests%20lie%20in%20Natural%20Language%20Processing%2C%20with%20a%20particular%20focus%20on%20Information%20Retrieval%2C%20personalization%20in%20information%20access%20systems%2C%20personal%20and%20context-aware%20large%20language%20models%20(LLMs)%2C%20and%20disinformation%20detection%20in%20social%20media.%20She%20received%20the%202023%20Outstanding%20Research%20Contributions%20Award%20from%20the%20Web%20Intelligence%20Consortium.%20She%20is%20a%20member%20of%20Academia%20Europaea%20and%20a%20Fellow%20of%20ELLIS%2C%20the%20Web%20Intelligence%20Academy%2C%20the%20Asia-Pacific%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Association%20(AAIA)%2C%20and%20the%20International%20Fuzzy%20Systems%20Association%20(IFSA).%22%2C%22tooltipPlacement%22%3A%22top%22%2C%22tooltipOffset%22%3A10%2C%22tooltipTriggerClick%22%3A%22hover%22%7D" class="brz-css-1wm4rks">Gabriella Pasi</span></h4></div></div></div><div id="" class="brz-css-d-1wonu5h brz-css-hf7t1v brz-wrapper"><div class="brz-rich-text brz-rich-text__custom brz-css-d-1ehz5mr brz-css-lufohx" data-brz-custom-id="yBHZd7Tqhnvy"><div data-brz-translate-text="1"><p class="brz-text-lg-center brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-css-dqzu38" data-generated-css="brz-css-vSmcA" data-uniq-id="xbczU"><span style="color: rgb(71, 74, 81);">University Of Milano-bicocca</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section id="bqCbuInFdg2P_bqCbuInFdg2P" class="brz-section brz-css-d-ynf0il brz-css-ga58xr"><div class="brz-section__content brz-section--boxed brz-css-d-oh3bvl brz-css-n4r3vj" data-brz-custom-id="oiu2_LMhrX0i"><div class="brz-bg"><div class="brz-bg-color"></div></div><div class="brz-container brz-css-d-x9rvyp brz-css-1qt6xm"><div id="" class="brz-css-d-1wonu5h brz-css-1jakaqr brz-wrapper"><div class="brz-rich-text brz-rich-text__custom brz-css-d-1ehz5mr brz-css-1lpjgo2" data-brz-custom-id="wJa1jTieOP7E"><div data-brz-translate-text="1"><h3 class="brz-tp-lg-heading3 brz-text-lg-center brz-css-c_R98" data-uniq-id="lixe2" data-generated-css="brz-css-sXfRE"><span class="brz-cp-color1" style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); color: rgba(var(--brz-global-color1),1); text-shadow: none;">Ethics and Professional Conduct</span></h3><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-ziTKA" data-uniq-id="qjESn" data-generated-css="brz-css-jb8Lg"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">ECIR 2027 expects authors (as well as the PC and the organising committee) to adhere to accepted standards on ethics and professionalism in our community, namely:</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-zsfEQ" data-uniq-id="zhuYT" data-generated-css="brz-css-oSlT0"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;"> </span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-srGUh" data-uniq-id="pUVcZ" data-generated-css="brz-css-a4FiJ"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">The&nbsp;</span><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none; color: rgb(16, 88, 177);" href="https://www.acm.org/publications/policies/new-acm-policy-on-authorship" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">ACM's Policy on Authorship</a><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">,</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-y2Rhi" data-uniq-id="hKVag" data-generated-css="brz-css-nN7Ch"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">The&nbsp;</span><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none; color: rgb(16, 88, 177);" href="https://www.acm.org/code-of-ethics" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">ACM's Code of Ethics and Professional Conduct</a><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">,</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-eKl87" data-uniq-id="azKrp" data-generated-css="brz-css-aW2Xz"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">The&nbsp;</span><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none; color: rgb(16, 88, 177);" href="https://www.acm.org/special-interest-groups/volunteer-resources/acm-conflict-of-interest-policy" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">ACM's Conflict of Interest Policy</a><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">,</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-voQyo" data-uniq-id="kzBXH" data-generated-css="brz-css-hw1Mb"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">The&nbsp;</span><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none; color: rgb(16, 88, 177);" href="https://www.acm.org/publications/policies/plagiarism-overview" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">ACM's Policy on Plagiarism, Misrepresentation, and Falsification</a><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">,</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-jD0Mh" data-uniq-id="iaiKc" data-generated-css="brz-css-o5emX"><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none;">The&nbsp;</span><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="text-shadow: none; color: rgb(16, 88, 177);" href="https://www.acm.org/about-acm/policy-against-harassment" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">ACM's Policy Against Harassment</a></p><p data-uniq-id="fYT5E" data-generated-css="brz-css-gA0Vt" class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-text-lg-center brz-css-oQpUn"><a class="link--external brz-cp-color7" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(71, 74, 81); text-shadow: none;" href="https://www.acm.org/about-acm/policy-against-harassment" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Springer Verlag’s</a><span class="brz-cp-color7" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(71, 74, 81); text-shadow: none;"> </span><a class="brz-cp-color7 link--external" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-shadow: none;" href="https://link.springer.com/brands/springer/journal-policies#Artificial%20intelligence%20(AI)" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">AI policy</a><a class="brz-cp-color7 link--external" style="color: rgb(16, 88, 177); text-shadow: none;" href="https://link.springer.com/brands/springer/journal-policies#Artificial%20intelligence%20(AI)" data-brz-link-type="external" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> </a></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-paragraph brz-css-afT3D" data-uniq-id="eU0AH" data-generated-css="brz-css-vsGQh"><br></p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
